4 <= 4 OK\nTask 1: srd032 R2.1(w=1) + R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) + R3.1(w=1) = 4 <= 4 OK\nTask 2: srd032 R3.2(w=1) + R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) + R4.3(w=1) = 4 <= 4 OK\nTask 3: srd032 R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) + R1.4(w=1) = 4 <= 4 OK\n```\n\n## Proposed Tasks\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"cmd/sha256sum core hashing implementation (srd032 R1.1, R1.2, R1.3, R1.4)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd032-sha256sum.yaml (full SRD -- read all requirements)\n      - pkg/hashutil/ (shared checksum protocol library -- read all .go files for HashConfig, DigestFiles, FormatGNU API)\n      - cmd/md5sum/main.go (reference implementation -- follow this pattern exactly)\n      - pkg/sys/ (InstallSIGPIPEHandler function)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/sha256sum/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: sha256sum utility -- core hashing, file I/O, output format\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd032 R1.1 -- compute SHA-256 digest for each file argument using pkg/hashutil.DigestFiles with crypto/sha256.New as the hash function and DigestLen 32\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd032 R1.2 -- output digest in GNU two-space format for text mode and asterisk format for binary mode via pkg/hashutil.FormatGNU\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd032 R1.3 -- read from stdin when no file arguments are given or when '-' is specified as a filename\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd032 R1.4 -- support -b/--binary and -t/--text mode flags; default to text mode\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Create hashutil.HashConfig with Algorithm 'SHA256', NewHash crypto/sha256.New, DigestLen 32\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per project convention for all cmd/ utilities\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Follow the same flag parsing and control flo